The code of this repository (make_figures.py, plotting/ and notebooks/) is licensed under the MIT
License, below. The data (data/) and the figures (figures/) are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/.
If you use them, please cite the paper (see README.md).

The observed events in data/events.json come from the public data release of the IceCube DeepCore
oscillation analysis (doi:10.7910/DVN/B4RITM), which is in the public domain (CC0 1.0). The land
outlines in data/earth.json come from Natural Earth, also in the public domain.


